{"id":"juillet","lemma":"juillet","pos":"noun","rank":2510,"glosses":["July"],"ipa":"/ʒɥi.jɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b9/Fr-juillet.ogg/Fr-juillet.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"juillets"},"formAudio":{"juillets":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-juillets.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je viens ici tous les 4 juillet.","en":"I come here every Fourth of July.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Il est né le 28 juillet 1888.","en":"He was born on July 28th, 1888.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to be born","l":"naître"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je commencerai à travailler le premier juillet.","en":"I will start working on July first.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to work"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"first"},null]},{"text":"Les vacances d'été commencent en juillet.","en":"The summer vacation begins in July.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"vacancy","l":"vacance"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons beaucoup de pluie en juin et juillet.","en":"We have a lot of rain in June and July.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"rain"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"June"},{"g":"and"},null]}]}